# Draftout

Next.js 15 App Router **product landing**: TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion.

- Minecraft 1v1 mode: draft → race → lockout (13/25 goals). Free; no pricing on v1.
- Sections: Hero → How it works (Draft/Race/Lockout) → **Board** (interactive 5×5 showcase) → Competitive/Elo → Social proof → FAQ → CTA.
- Static-first; SEO and performance over interactivity.
- Sections in `components/sections/`; shared UI in `components/`.
- Use `next/image`, semantic landmarks, one clear CTA per viewport.
- Dev: `npm run dev` or `docker compose up` (port 3000).

See `AGENTS.md` for full stack and animation rules.
